00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:58,280
So if you guys want to give opinions to anybody, that's pretty good if you ask me.

259
00:15:58,280 --> 00:15:58,600
All right.

260
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:06,080
Salvation, future tense expectation where Christians wait to receive their eternal inheritance from their heavenly father.

261
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:10,860
We brought into this family, and with that family comes an eternal inheritance.

262
00:16:10,860 --> 00:16:13,200
Everything that the father owns will become ours.

263
00:16:14,580 --> 00:16:20,500
