265
00:16:23,900 --> 00:16:33,140
That phrase summarizes the tension that we experience between our past and our present tense salvation in light of our future tense salvation.

266
00:16:33,140 --> 00:16:36,920
We know that there is a kingdom that is greater than the kingdom of this world.

267
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:39,380
That that kingdom will come eventually.

268
00:16:39,580 --> 00:16:44,880
