00:19:29,460 --> 00:19:37,180
Even before God made the world, he loved us and chose us in Christ to be holy and without fault in his eyes.

313
00:19:37,180 --> 00:19:44,680
God decided and advanced to adopt us into his own family by bringing us to himself through Jesus Christ.

