00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:45,300
It wasn't something that God was surprised by or shocked by.

325
00:20:45,300 --> 00:20:54,500
It was God's eternal plan in creation to demonstrate his love for us in that while we were his enemies, Christ died for us.

326
00:20:54,500 --> 00:21:00,080
It was his good pleasure to do so, so that we would understand his great heart of love towards his people.

327
00:21:00,080 --> 00:21:08,380
God chose to participate in this past tense salvation by creating us, knowing that we would rebel against him in eternity past.

